  "主要内容": "WATERS CORP /DE/ — 8-K — 2012-05-11: The Board of Directors authorized the repurchase of up to $750,000,000 of its outstanding common stock over a 2-year period (the May 2012 program). As of May 9, 2012, $80,862,000 remains authorized for future repurchases under the February 2011 program. The Company intends to complete the February 2011 program before repurchasing additional common stock under the May 2012 program.",
